{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"The branch code exposes two important protocol gaps. Pluto’s legacy CFO estimator reads across the capture, and CTTC’s legacy alignment uses known source symbols at several capture times. I’ll keep both as historical references and specify a causal frontend for the Stage 4 comparison. I’ll also test the repeated scalar embedding and its full-rank counterpart on the frozen encoder."}}
